WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.246 --> 00:00:05.421
(traditional Pakistani music)

00:00:05.421 --> 00:00:09.588
- [Narrator] Ashiq Ali is a
motorcycle mechanic in Pakistan.

00:00:10.678 --> 00:00:14.075
He works in an area where
owning a car or motorcycle

00:00:14.075 --> 00:00:17.293
is out of reach for some residents.

00:00:17.293 --> 00:00:20.444
But Ashiq found a way that he could help.

00:00:20.444 --> 00:00:23.199
For the last 10 years,
he's been giving rides

00:00:23.199 --> 00:00:24.847
on the back of his motorcycle

00:00:24.847 --> 00:00:27.597
to anyone who needs one for free.

00:00:28.604 --> 00:00:32.271
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:20.942 --> 00:01:24.370
- [Narrator] But at first,
people were skeptical.

00:01:24.370 --> 00:01:27.462
To gain their trust,
Ashiq's best friend, Zafar,

00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:28.718
gave him the idea to play

00:01:28.718 --> 00:01:31.885
recordings of the Quran from his bike.

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:36.331
Now, the two friends ride together,

00:01:36.331 --> 00:01:39.581
picking up passengers wherever they go.

00:01:42.421 --> 00:01:46.088
(speaking foreign language)

